WEBVTT

01:37.539 --> 01:42.930
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.330 --> 01:46.020
[Episode 26]

01:53.840 --> 01:54.870
My Lady,

01:55.200 --> 01:57.430
the Heir hasn't touched his bow in days.

01:57.560 --> 02:00.160
There's no need
to restring it for him anymore.

02:02.760 --> 02:03.510
Luzhui.

02:05.200 --> 02:06.200
Do you remember

02:07.640 --> 02:08.280
how old we were

02:08.280 --> 02:10.430
when I first

02:10.800 --> 02:11.870
met Chunzhi?

02:14.680 --> 02:15.800
He had just started

02:15.800 --> 02:17.460
learning horseback archery.

02:17.870 --> 02:19.000
Every arrow he shot

02:19.360 --> 02:20.800
hit the bullseye.

02:21.190 --> 02:22.430
I remember thinking,

02:23.240 --> 02:25.710
how could there be
such a spirited young man?

02:26.520 --> 02:28.180
It was as if he were the only one

02:28.360 --> 02:30.430
in all of Hengtang who was shining.

02:32.800 --> 02:34.910
So you've been in love with the Heir

02:35.310 --> 02:36.470
since then?

02:41.000 --> 02:42.200
Before I got married,

02:42.630 --> 02:45.190
I was always trailing after him,

02:45.400 --> 02:46.870
calling him Chunzhi.

02:47.560 --> 02:50.360
My greatest wish since childhood
was to marry him.

02:51.030 --> 02:53.280
It felt like it was destined.

02:54.000 --> 02:56.120
I thought Chunzhi was mine.

02:58.560 --> 03:00.690
And he was always good to me, actually.

03:01.240 --> 03:02.400
He'd have gifts

03:02.710 --> 03:04.240
ready for me every holiday,

03:04.430 --> 03:06.590
and he'd gently call me Second Sister.

03:07.430 --> 03:08.960
Whenever he traveled far,

03:08.960 --> 03:11.890
he'd always bring back
little gifts to make me happy.

03:12.750 --> 03:14.590
He was always so considerate.

03:17.840 --> 03:18.800
But I know

03:20.630 --> 03:21.870
this marriage

03:23.280 --> 03:24.480
is something I stole.

03:26.150 --> 03:27.750
He may resent me

03:28.310 --> 03:29.770
for a very, very long time.

03:38.870 --> 03:39.870
But I got to marry

03:40.400 --> 03:41.710
the man I'd admired

03:41.710 --> 03:43.240
since I was a child anyway.

03:45.560 --> 03:46.400
But he

03:48.870 --> 03:50.470
could only watch helplessly

03:54.560 --> 03:56.079
as his beloved

03:57.470 --> 03:59.000
married someone else.

04:03.590 --> 04:05.320
If he holds a grudge against me,

04:05.750 --> 04:06.960
I deserve it.

04:09.840 --> 04:11.560
It's the price I chose to pay.

04:14.590 --> 04:15.750
I don't blame him.

04:18.390 --> 04:19.480
I will bear it.

04:26.360 --> 04:27.430
I only want him...

04:30.070 --> 04:32.270
to be the spirited young man he once was,

04:33.310 --> 04:34.680
bow in hand,

04:36.630 --> 04:38.560
riding tall and proud.

04:54.870 --> 04:55.630
My Lady.

05:00.240 --> 05:01.950
Keep this bow for me.

05:03.680 --> 05:04.610
I firmly believe

05:06.560 --> 05:07.560
that Chunzhi

05:08.870 --> 05:10.870
will pull himself together one day.

05:14.040 --> 05:17.360
"With wine, we sing.

05:17.360 --> 05:20.310
How brief is life?

05:20.310 --> 05:21.630
Like morning dew, fleeting and gone.

05:21.630 --> 05:23.730
So much time has slipped away."

05:24.720 --> 05:25.430
Marquis.

05:25.800 --> 05:27.040
Commissioner Hu.

05:27.040 --> 05:28.970
Long time no see. How have you been?

05:29.390 --> 05:30.360
Very well.

05:30.360 --> 05:31.270
Thank you. Come on.

05:31.270 --> 05:31.930
Have a seat.

05:32.040 --> 05:32.750
Please.

05:33.630 --> 05:34.190
Marquis,

05:34.310 --> 05:35.950
you're just as punctual

05:36.270 --> 05:38.480
as ever.

05:38.870 --> 05:40.720
I'm old now. Unlike you.

05:40.920 --> 05:42.480
You are busy
with official business all day.

05:42.480 --> 05:44.750
I have nothing to do anyway.

05:45.720 --> 05:46.680
So when you invited me,

05:46.680 --> 05:47.830
of course

05:48.310 --> 05:49.800
I came right on time.

05:51.630 --> 05:52.390
Marquis,

05:53.159 --> 05:54.630
you've shut yourself away for so long.

05:54.630 --> 05:56.430
I thought inviting you out

05:56.630 --> 05:58.310
would take quite some effort.

05:58.750 --> 06:00.040
But you came at once.

06:00.270 --> 06:02.070
I must admit, that surprised me.

06:03.240 --> 06:04.640
Looks like you're really

06:05.190 --> 06:06.750
doing me a favor.

06:07.720 --> 06:08.510
Commissioner Hu,

06:08.510 --> 06:10.560
things are different now.

06:10.870 --> 06:12.160
You're in the capital,

06:12.160 --> 06:15.680
while I'm still here
in this little Hengtang.

06:15.870 --> 06:17.160
Our positions are no longer the same.

06:17.160 --> 06:18.310
So when you invited me,

06:18.310 --> 06:20.830
I naturally came as fast as I could.

06:21.600 --> 06:22.390
Here, Marquis.

06:22.390 --> 06:23.000
Please.

06:24.920 --> 06:27.040
There isn't poison in this wine, is there?

06:27.040 --> 06:29.240
You must be joking, Marquis.

06:30.270 --> 06:31.310
I'll drink first.

06:31.310 --> 06:31.920
Alright.

06:39.120 --> 06:39.870
Good wine.

06:40.159 --> 06:41.120
Good food!

06:41.630 --> 06:43.510
If you eat this every day,
Commissioner Hu,

06:43.510 --> 06:45.159
you're really lucky.

06:47.870 --> 06:48.720
Marquis.

06:49.750 --> 06:50.600
If

06:50.870 --> 06:52.870
you like the food my chefs cook,

06:53.560 --> 06:54.480
I will order them

06:54.480 --> 06:55.880
to cook for you every day.

06:56.240 --> 06:57.750
If you like my wine,

06:58.310 --> 07:00.040
you can have as much as you want.

07:00.310 --> 07:01.070
I am old.

07:01.190 --> 07:01.950
I can't eat

07:01.950 --> 07:03.000
or drink much anymore.

07:03.000 --> 07:03.680
However...

07:05.310 --> 07:05.920
Marquis,

07:07.430 --> 07:09.000
you have to do me a favor.

07:09.800 --> 07:10.530
I'm all ears.

07:11.480 --> 07:12.950
I suppose you've heard.

07:13.870 --> 07:14.630
Right now,

07:15.360 --> 07:16.800
these students,

07:16.800 --> 07:18.310
incited by others,

07:18.720 --> 07:20.190
have been speaking recklessly

07:20.190 --> 07:21.560
and writing inflammatory articles.

07:21.560 --> 07:24.160
And they seem to be gathering
in large numbers.

07:24.630 --> 07:25.310
Marquis,

07:26.190 --> 07:27.720
I'd like to ask you to step in

07:28.190 --> 07:30.510
and help me keep things under control.

07:31.240 --> 07:32.360
You still command

07:32.680 --> 07:34.240
great respect in Hengtang.

07:34.720 --> 07:36.950
Your standing here
hasn't diminished at all.

07:36.950 --> 07:39.240
All you need to do is calm them down.

07:40.040 --> 07:41.240
Once this is settled,

07:43.040 --> 07:44.000
I promise that

07:44.480 --> 07:46.409
as far as the capital is concerned,

07:46.870 --> 07:49.800
you'll always be the Marquis of Danyang
in Hengtang.

07:53.360 --> 07:54.600
Commissioner Hu,

07:54.800 --> 07:56.830
how am I supposed to help you with this?

07:56.830 --> 07:57.800
I'm

07:57.800 --> 07:58.600
old now.

07:58.870 --> 08:00.070
No one

08:00.160 --> 08:01.420
listens to me anymore.

08:02.510 --> 08:03.600
Back then,

08:03.830 --> 08:05.640
when you were in Hengtang,

08:05.720 --> 08:06.830
you were just

08:07.160 --> 08:08.620
a low-ranking inspector.

08:08.750 --> 08:10.120
Whenever someone came from the capital,

08:10.120 --> 08:12.430
you'd wait on the sidelines
and play along.

08:12.430 --> 08:13.430
I remember

08:13.720 --> 08:14.870
it was right here,

08:15.870 --> 08:16.870
in that corner.

08:17.510 --> 08:19.510
You were sitting way off to the side,

08:19.950 --> 08:21.940
watching everyone's reactions,

08:22.270 --> 08:24.240
looking for someone
who could be useful to you,

08:24.240 --> 08:26.800
someone who could help you
rise through the ranks.

08:26.800 --> 08:28.390
And your efforts paid off!

08:28.390 --> 08:30.190
You actually found one.

08:31.680 --> 08:33.909
Eunuch Xia, who the late Emperor sent here

08:33.909 --> 08:35.360
to run errands.

08:36.750 --> 08:37.870
From then on,

08:37.870 --> 08:39.120
you've been going around

08:39.120 --> 08:42.080
gathering dirt on officials.

08:42.390 --> 08:44.049
You remember that, don't you?

08:44.150 --> 08:45.670
That Shen Zhibai

08:46.200 --> 08:47.530
you wrongfully accused

08:49.550 --> 08:51.200
was killed by you.

08:52.480 --> 08:55.610
In doing so, you eliminated
a major threat to Eunuch Xia!

08:55.870 --> 08:57.030
And Eunuch Xia

08:57.550 --> 08:59.000
was pleased about it.

08:59.550 --> 09:00.750
A few years later,

09:01.000 --> 09:01.880
you...

09:02.390 --> 09:03.450
went to the capital

09:03.840 --> 09:06.870
and rose through the ranks all the way
to where you are now!

09:06.870 --> 09:09.360
Years later, you killed his son,

09:09.750 --> 09:11.670
Shen Run, too.

09:12.750 --> 09:13.510
Right?

09:15.480 --> 09:16.960
Just look at Hengtang now.

09:18.960 --> 09:21.420
It's practically become your own backyard.

09:21.960 --> 09:23.360
As for my military power,

09:23.870 --> 09:24.960
if you want it,

09:25.240 --> 09:26.000
just take it.

09:26.000 --> 09:27.600
I'll hand it over willingly!

09:30.030 --> 09:31.030
Commissioner Hu,

09:31.270 --> 09:32.270
back then,

09:35.000 --> 09:36.720
I really underestimated you.

09:40.030 --> 09:40.870
Marquis.

09:45.360 --> 09:46.600
Looks like

09:47.600 --> 09:48.790
you've made up your mind

09:48.790 --> 09:50.750
not to give me face today.

09:52.550 --> 09:55.600
You're even bringing up
things from a lifetime ago.

09:56.360 --> 09:57.420
If that's the case,

09:58.360 --> 09:59.870
let me remind you.

10:00.870 --> 10:01.720
Please go ahead.

10:01.720 --> 10:03.840
As for the Shen Zhibai case,

10:04.030 --> 10:06.790
it was the late Emperor who ordered you

10:07.150 --> 10:08.550
to investigate it.

10:08.960 --> 10:09.670
Yes.

10:10.360 --> 10:13.440
The evidence in that case was conclusive,

10:13.510 --> 10:14.910
and everyone told the same story.

10:14.910 --> 10:16.910
What could I have done?

10:17.910 --> 10:20.640
When the late Emperor
sent me to handle that case,

10:20.840 --> 10:21.750
he was only

10:21.750 --> 10:23.480
going through the motions.

10:23.720 --> 10:24.790
It's just a pity.

10:25.550 --> 10:28.390
A pity about Shen Zhibai.

10:29.870 --> 10:32.080
Back when you were young and ambitious,

10:33.720 --> 10:36.670
you knew better than
to put yourself in danger.

10:37.390 --> 10:38.510
You could even

10:39.510 --> 10:41.200
let us off the hook.

10:42.120 --> 10:43.360
After that case,

10:43.790 --> 10:47.550
you stayed behind the scenes for years,

10:47.870 --> 10:49.670
keeping a tight grip on the army.

10:49.870 --> 10:51.870
You were afraid we'd infiltrate it.

10:52.790 --> 10:54.720
What a smart man.

10:55.720 --> 10:58.120
You could act like that
when you were young.

10:58.510 --> 11:00.510
So how is it that now, in your old age,

11:01.000 --> 11:02.440
you can't let this go?

11:09.440 --> 11:10.440
Commissioner Hu.

11:13.360 --> 11:14.720
Back then,

11:15.910 --> 11:18.080
I was forced by circumstances.

11:20.150 --> 11:22.870
All the officials in Hengtang,
big and small,

11:24.320 --> 11:26.000
had become your men.

11:26.550 --> 11:28.360
That case of Shen Zhibai,

11:29.720 --> 11:31.790
you handled it flawlessly.

11:33.480 --> 11:35.240
Shen Zhibai led a faction

11:35.630 --> 11:37.360
of upright officials

11:37.510 --> 11:40.030
and pushed hard for the new policies,

11:40.440 --> 11:43.570
clashing with Eunuch Xia and his faction
time and again.

11:43.670 --> 11:45.080
Eunuch Xia

11:45.600 --> 11:47.530
had spent years building his power

11:48.120 --> 11:49.390
in the court,

11:50.510 --> 11:52.790
and no one could shake him.

11:53.440 --> 11:54.790
As for the late Emperor,

11:55.240 --> 11:56.970
he could never make up his mind.

11:57.240 --> 11:58.150
And I

11:58.550 --> 12:00.960
could only stand by and watch,

12:03.510 --> 12:05.390
making sure the troops in Hengtang

12:05.390 --> 12:06.750
stayed in order.

12:10.200 --> 12:11.320
What a pity.

12:12.240 --> 12:13.440
I failed to find

12:14.240 --> 12:16.550
a way out for Shen Zhibai,

12:17.200 --> 12:19.510
nor did I persuade the late Emperor

12:21.960 --> 12:23.560
to support the new policies.

12:32.630 --> 12:34.000
You...

12:34.720 --> 12:35.670
Oh, you.

12:37.000 --> 12:39.600
You're just like that dead Shen Zhibai.

12:40.480 --> 12:42.320
Neither of you ever knew

12:42.320 --> 12:44.150
who your real enemy was.

12:45.030 --> 12:46.360
Do you really think

12:46.360 --> 12:48.550
I was your only enemy?

12:52.510 --> 12:54.170
From Hengtang to the capital,

12:54.630 --> 12:57.440
how many people wanted Shen Zhibai dead?

12:58.000 --> 12:59.200
Do you know why?

12:59.750 --> 13:01.910
That so-called political turmoil

13:02.670 --> 13:03.840
was tied to

13:04.120 --> 13:06.910
the very foundation
of Jiangnan's tax revenue.

13:07.480 --> 13:08.910
Once this was tampered with,

13:08.910 --> 13:11.000
the whole system would've been thrown

13:11.000 --> 13:11.960
into chaos.

13:13.910 --> 13:15.510
Do you think the late Emperor

13:15.510 --> 13:17.150
would sit by and watch

13:17.360 --> 13:19.490
Jiangnan's coffers become unstable?

13:26.750 --> 13:27.630
The wine—

13:28.440 --> 13:29.700
if you can't finish it,

13:30.670 --> 13:32.200
don't force yourself.

13:37.790 --> 13:40.080
You've stayed behind closed doors
for years.

13:40.080 --> 13:41.680
On the surface, it looks like

13:42.670 --> 13:44.530
you've withdrawn from the world.

13:45.000 --> 13:45.790
In truth,

13:46.510 --> 13:48.240
you don't want anyone to know

13:48.870 --> 13:49.530
that you...

13:50.270 --> 13:50.750
are ill!

13:54.200 --> 13:56.730
A wise bird
chooses the right tree to perch in.

13:58.000 --> 14:01.510
Birds don't wait for a dead tree to fall
before they fly away.

14:02.360 --> 14:04.200
The generals under your command

14:04.840 --> 14:06.200
have already

14:06.630 --> 14:08.290
secretly reported this to me.

14:09.790 --> 14:10.440
However,

14:11.000 --> 14:12.330
you needn't blame them.

14:12.910 --> 14:14.110
If anyone's to blame,

14:15.910 --> 14:18.550
blame your useless heir.

14:19.270 --> 14:20.150
Your soldiers

14:20.150 --> 14:21.600
saw no ability in him

14:21.750 --> 14:24.390
to take charge of what lies ahead!

14:26.000 --> 14:26.790
However,

14:28.320 --> 14:29.390
you won't know

14:30.630 --> 14:31.560
what will happen

14:32.150 --> 14:33.080
in the future.

14:34.200 --> 14:35.200
Commissioner Hu.

14:37.510 --> 14:38.670
I have tried my best

14:39.480 --> 14:41.000
to stop you.

14:43.150 --> 14:43.960
There's...

14:45.960 --> 14:47.670
no need to say more.

14:57.550 --> 14:58.240
Guards.

15:00.750 --> 15:03.000
Send the Marquis on his way.

15:11.630 --> 15:14.440
"With wine, we sing.

15:14.440 --> 15:17.750
How brief is life?

15:17.750 --> 15:18.910
Like morning dew, fleeting and gone.

15:18.910 --> 15:20.600
So much time has slipped away.

15:20.600 --> 15:22.630
Sing with passion,

15:22.630 --> 15:25.080
yet the deep sorrow is hard to forget.

15:25.080 --> 15:27.120
How to relieve this sorrow?

15:27.120 --> 15:28.910
Only with...

15:29.390 --> 15:33.480
good wine!"

15:41.810 --> 15:49.810
[Zhongwu Hall]

15:44.200 --> 15:45.120
Chunzhi.

15:46.270 --> 15:49.720
There is one thing
I hope you will always remember.

15:50.240 --> 15:52.120
Even without your parents,

15:52.870 --> 15:54.960
without the title of Marquis,

15:56.030 --> 15:57.690
and without the Danyang Army,

15:58.150 --> 15:59.480
as long as you're alive,

15:59.870 --> 16:02.870
you can still help those you want to help.

16:03.840 --> 16:05.440
As long as you're still here,

16:06.750 --> 16:09.080
as long as you want to get back
on your feet,

16:09.960 --> 16:12.560
that's the last trump card
your father has left

16:13.320 --> 16:15.440
for Hengtang.

16:19.440 --> 16:20.080
Father.

16:21.240 --> 16:21.840
I feel...

16:23.550 --> 16:25.150
you are different from usual.

16:25.150 --> 16:26.480
Are you feeling unwell?

16:28.550 --> 16:29.360
No.

16:32.270 --> 16:33.240
Chunzhi,

16:35.510 --> 16:39.440
I'm leaving the Marquis's household
to you and Qingru.

16:50.910 --> 16:52.080
And Hengtang...

17:00.910 --> 17:02.480
as well.

17:07.550 --> 17:08.160
Yes,

17:09.510 --> 17:10.109
Father.

17:14.750 --> 17:15.720
How long will this world

17:15.720 --> 17:17.160
remain so unfair?

17:17.550 --> 17:18.960
His Lordship died unjustly.

17:18.960 --> 17:21.270
Hengtang has lost
its last bit of conscience!

17:21.270 --> 17:22.640
Eternal glory to His Lordship.

17:22.640 --> 17:23.200
We

17:23.440 --> 17:25.109
shall follow his heroic spirit!

17:25.109 --> 17:27.440
We absolutely cannot just sit
and wait for death!

17:27.440 --> 17:28.550
Now, more than ever,

17:28.550 --> 17:30.200
we must stand together!

17:30.440 --> 17:33.040
We swear to kill the traitors
of Xia's faction!

17:33.160 --> 17:35.400
We swear to kill the traitors
of Xia's faction!

17:35.400 --> 17:37.680
We swear to kill the traitors
of Xia's faction!

17:37.680 --> 17:38.880
Avenge His Lordship!

17:39.030 --> 17:40.540
We must not let Hu Xing get away!

17:40.540 --> 17:42.140
Avenge His Lordship!

17:42.160 --> 17:44.120
Avenge His Lordship!

17:44.140 --> 17:46.890
Avenge His Lordship!

17:46.920 --> 17:48.900
Avenge His Lordship!

17:48.920 --> 17:50.390
Avenge His Lordship!

17:50.420 --> 17:51.890
Avenge His Lordship!

17:51.920 --> 17:53.370
Avenge His Lordship!

17:53.500 --> 17:57.160
[Qinyue Corridor]

17:57.230 --> 18:02.120
[Danyue Pavilion]

18:49.640 --> 18:54.140
[A few days ago]

18:51.200 --> 18:51.730
Brother,

18:52.110 --> 18:53.550
you didn't explain in detail

18:53.550 --> 18:55.280
what else we need for this plan.

18:55.400 --> 18:56.800
His Majesty's intention

18:57.000 --> 18:58.240
in sending us back to Hengtang

18:58.240 --> 18:59.790
was for us to join forces with Xie Shu

18:59.790 --> 19:01.050
and bring Hu Xing down.

19:01.200 --> 19:02.600
But I discovered long ago

19:02.750 --> 19:04.010
that Xie Shu and Hu Xing

19:04.200 --> 19:05.480
had already joined forces

19:05.480 --> 19:06.810
and were firmly united.

19:07.110 --> 19:09.110
Xie Shu appears to ally with me
on the surface,

19:09.110 --> 19:11.680
but secretly he's in league with Hu Xing.

19:11.920 --> 19:13.070
Now we're in the open

19:13.070 --> 19:14.030
while he's in the shadows,

19:14.030 --> 19:15.960
putting us at a serious disadvantage.

19:15.960 --> 19:17.290
To break this deadlock,

19:17.440 --> 19:18.970
we need an unexpected move.

19:19.200 --> 19:20.600
We need to fake his death.

19:20.920 --> 19:23.120
If they believe Shen Run is really dead,

19:23.240 --> 19:25.200
they'll surely grow reckless
and make their move.

19:25.200 --> 19:26.270
Then we'll be in the shadows

19:26.270 --> 19:27.160
and they will be in the open.

19:27.160 --> 19:28.240
We'll use a retreat to gain the upper hand

19:28.240 --> 19:29.700
and seize their lifeline.

19:29.880 --> 19:31.590
But now Hengtang is united.

19:32.030 --> 19:33.760
How do we seize their lifeline?

19:34.480 --> 19:36.080
That's where you two come in.

19:36.550 --> 19:37.240
Hengtang

19:37.550 --> 19:39.270
doesn't belong to the noble families.

19:39.270 --> 19:40.310
No matter how many noble families
there are,

19:40.310 --> 19:41.720
they're still outnumbered
by the common people.

19:41.720 --> 19:43.200
Since Hu Xing returned,

19:43.920 --> 19:46.160
the officials and noble families
have exploited the people even more,

19:46.160 --> 19:48.640
causing
the number of landless refugees to soar.

19:48.640 --> 19:51.370
Those refugees
should have been their lifeline,

19:51.640 --> 19:54.100
yet in their eyes,
they're nothing but dust.

19:55.200 --> 19:55.960
I want you two

19:57.310 --> 19:59.240
to gather that dust into one force.

19:59.480 --> 20:00.480
Together with me,

20:00.640 --> 20:02.170
we'll set Hengtang ablaze.

20:03.400 --> 20:04.130
Understood.

20:05.440 --> 20:06.880
We'll leave the city tonight,

20:06.880 --> 20:08.610
pretending to go sightseeing.

20:09.000 --> 20:10.030
Once we're outside the city,

20:10.030 --> 20:11.160
we'll sneak back in.

20:11.310 --> 20:12.750
Once we've organized the refugees,

20:12.750 --> 20:14.350
we'll contact you in secret.

20:17.030 --> 20:17.640
Alright.

20:18.270 --> 20:20.070
Now there is only one thing left—

20:20.680 --> 20:22.280
to make my death convincing.

20:22.720 --> 20:24.030
The more real, the better.

20:24.030 --> 20:24.830
Che,

20:25.960 --> 20:26.920
I want you

20:28.000 --> 20:28.750
to stab me.

20:31.830 --> 20:33.030
To fool the coroner,

20:33.200 --> 20:35.590
the wound
has to be in exactly the right place

20:35.590 --> 20:37.350
to look fatal.

20:40.440 --> 20:42.440
But even if it's not actually fatal,

20:42.510 --> 20:44.510
you'll still be seriously injured.

20:44.790 --> 20:45.850
Don't worry, dear.

20:46.440 --> 20:47.110
I can

20:47.680 --> 20:48.590
take it.

20:51.550 --> 20:52.350
Brother,

20:53.000 --> 20:54.130
I can't bring myself

20:54.350 --> 20:55.400
to do it.

20:55.920 --> 20:57.580
I'm afraid I'll miss the mark.

21:01.680 --> 21:02.400
My Lord.

21:03.350 --> 21:06.010
We... We can't bring ourselves
to do it anymore.

21:07.830 --> 21:08.590
Then who...

21:09.440 --> 21:10.480
will do it?

21:10.790 --> 21:11.350
I will!

21:12.790 --> 21:13.880
I heard everything

21:13.900 --> 21:15.720
you said to your wife about Lord Shen's

21:15.720 --> 21:16.720
dying wish today.

21:17.070 --> 21:19.600
Every word echoed
what I think and what I want.

21:20.160 --> 21:21.920
I used to think
breaking the noble families' monopoly

21:21.920 --> 21:24.070
and bringing prosperity to the people
was nothing but an empty promise.

21:24.070 --> 21:26.510
But now, it seems we may actually
have a chance to make it happen.

21:26.510 --> 21:29.070
Before, I was just bound
by the imperial order.

21:29.070 --> 21:32.070
I didn't really want to
make things difficult for you.

21:34.110 --> 21:34.640
Feng En.

21:35.720 --> 21:37.320
I understand your concerns.

21:37.960 --> 21:38.690
Don't worry.

21:39.110 --> 21:40.350
After I fake my death,

21:40.640 --> 21:42.160
I'll go straight to the capital

21:42.160 --> 21:44.360
and explain everything to His Majesty.

21:45.400 --> 21:46.200
Rest assured.

21:46.550 --> 21:48.510
Even if His Majesty insists
on punishing me,

21:48.510 --> 21:50.270
I'll accept the punishment willingly.

21:50.270 --> 21:52.070
We risked our lives and fought our way

21:52.070 --> 21:53.720
through the bloodshed
on the Northern Frontier,

21:53.720 --> 21:55.400
with our blades pointed at the enemy.

21:55.400 --> 21:58.050
And now you're fighting corrupt officials.

21:58.440 --> 21:59.680
How could I possibly bring myself to be

21:59.680 --> 22:01.830
just an executioner
who points my blade inward?

22:01.830 --> 22:02.760
If word gets out,

22:02.880 --> 22:04.940
our fallen brothers will laugh at me.

22:07.830 --> 22:09.160
Feng En, remember this.

22:09.440 --> 22:10.400
After this stab,

22:11.160 --> 22:13.470
go to Hu Xing at once
and surrender to him,

22:13.680 --> 22:14.680
using my death

22:14.680 --> 22:16.140
as your pledge of loyalty.

22:18.240 --> 22:18.700
Come on.

22:22.830 --> 22:23.890
Just one step away.

22:24.400 --> 22:25.330
We must succeed.

22:25.640 --> 22:26.100
Cheers!

22:26.150 --> 22:26.570
Cheers!

22:26.570 --> 22:27.190
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

22:27.190 --> 22:33.380
[Shen Residence]

22:30.790 --> 22:31.320
Brother,

22:31.880 --> 22:33.010
no need to see me off.

22:33.640 --> 22:34.880
The medicine I just gave you

22:34.880 --> 22:37.110
is the same medicine
Mother gave me back then.

22:37.110 --> 22:38.270
For 6 hours,

22:38.270 --> 22:39.720
it can stop your heartbeat,

22:39.720 --> 22:40.790
make your body cold,

22:40.790 --> 22:42.590
and leave no detectable breath.

22:43.400 --> 22:45.400
This is how I deceived Wei Changyan.

22:46.030 --> 22:48.490
You can use it to deceive the coroner
as well.

22:54.070 --> 22:55.530
Does the wound still hurt?

22:56.160 --> 22:56.890
Not anymore.

22:56.960 --> 22:58.880
With the powder you prepared for me,

22:58.880 --> 23:00.480
it stopped hurting a long time ago.

23:00.480 --> 23:01.340
What about you?

23:01.750 --> 23:03.200
Have you been alright at the Xie Residence

23:03.200 --> 23:04.350
while I was away?

23:05.350 --> 23:06.030
I was fine.

23:06.400 --> 23:08.550
Xie Shu was keeping a close eye on me,

23:08.880 --> 23:10.160
but Madam Hu was seriously ill,

23:10.160 --> 23:12.110
so no one made things difficult for me.

23:12.110 --> 23:13.170
More importantly,

23:13.400 --> 23:15.240
I discovered the secret
of the bronze mirror.

23:15.240 --> 23:16.550
Madam Hu once told me

23:17.000 --> 23:17.920
that the mirror

23:18.110 --> 23:19.270
held the key to my mother's death

23:19.270 --> 23:20.470
and Xie Shu's secret.

23:20.790 --> 23:22.110
It was because of this secret

23:22.110 --> 23:23.970
that Xie Shu had to kill my mother.

23:24.440 --> 23:25.310
I investigated

23:25.310 --> 23:26.750
this mirror before,

23:26.920 --> 23:28.070
but I found nothing.

23:28.480 --> 23:29.480
Until that day...

23:32.400 --> 23:33.920
Lu Lingshu?

23:34.590 --> 23:35.550
Lu Lingshu?

23:37.590 --> 23:39.590
I've been working with Xie Shu
for so long,

23:39.590 --> 23:41.350
yet I've never heard of this person.

23:41.350 --> 23:42.310
I think I heard

23:42.750 --> 23:44.400
that name when I was little.

23:46.400 --> 23:48.480
Lady Lu even reminded us that no fires

23:49.310 --> 23:51.510
were allowed for 3 days
during the Cold Food Festival.

23:51.510 --> 23:54.030
She was afraid you and your daughter
wouldn't have enough to eat,

23:54.030 --> 23:56.160
so she even sent over some wheat cakes.

23:56.160 --> 23:58.820
I asked Xin Zhen
to ask our old neighbor about it.

23:59.350 --> 24:00.410
That neighbor said

24:00.510 --> 24:02.510
she'd never seen Lu Lingshu either.

24:02.830 --> 24:04.830
But the person who asked her
to take care of me

24:04.830 --> 24:06.760
was a nanny from the Xie Residence.

24:08.510 --> 24:09.480
So this person

24:10.400 --> 24:12.600
was very likely from the Xie Residence.

24:13.640 --> 24:14.110
Yes.

24:14.480 --> 24:15.480
But I haven't

24:15.640 --> 24:17.300
gotten to the bottom of it yet.

24:19.160 --> 24:20.480
Whoever Lu Lingshu is,

24:21.400 --> 24:24.000
she must be a closely guarded secret
of Xie Shu.

24:24.440 --> 24:25.770
If we uncover the truth,

24:26.480 --> 24:28.880
it could be the key
to bringing Xie Shu down.

24:29.070 --> 24:29.680
Dear,

24:30.410 --> 24:31.740
you'll have to be the one

24:31.830 --> 24:33.750
to strike this blow against Xie Shu.

24:33.750 --> 24:34.280
Alright.

24:34.750 --> 24:35.440
Commander,

24:35.550 --> 24:36.240
it's me.

24:37.110 --> 24:37.880
Come in.

24:40.270 --> 24:40.790
Feng En.

24:41.880 --> 24:44.110
I've already told His Majesty everything.

24:44.110 --> 24:45.590
He has pardoned you.

24:46.640 --> 24:47.300
Commander.

24:47.400 --> 24:47.880
Madam.

24:48.400 --> 24:49.550
After Marquis Li's death,

24:49.550 --> 24:50.510
Hu Xing and Xie Shu

24:50.510 --> 24:53.350
secretly ordered
2 rebel generals to gather troops.

24:53.350 --> 24:54.750
I'm afraid they are fully prepared

24:54.750 --> 24:55.720
to go to war.

24:56.680 --> 24:59.030
If His Lordship had stayed
at the Marquis of Danyang Residence,

24:59.030 --> 25:01.290
I would have risked my life to rescue him.

25:02.070 --> 25:03.200
But I never expected

25:03.510 --> 25:05.710
he would willingly attend the banquet.

25:06.160 --> 25:07.000
He was a hero.

25:08.350 --> 25:10.480
His Lordship went to the banquet
at the cost of his life,

25:10.480 --> 25:12.340
sacrificing himself for justice

25:12.400 --> 25:15.750
and using his own life
to break this suffocating balance.

25:16.350 --> 25:17.680
Those of us who are alive

25:18.510 --> 25:20.920
must continue on the path he pointed out.

25:21.590 --> 25:24.180
Shen Che and Dong Fangchun
are gathering refugees as planned,

25:24.180 --> 25:26.030
waiting for you to return and lead them.

25:26.030 --> 25:28.550
Zhou Peian
has also organized many students.

25:28.550 --> 25:29.200
Besides,

25:29.680 --> 25:32.540
I also secretly brought Magistrate Ye
to Hengtang.

25:32.640 --> 25:33.160
Good.

25:34.750 --> 25:35.750
It's finally time

25:35.920 --> 25:37.510
to start this fire.

25:42.960 --> 25:44.400
After all these years,

25:44.880 --> 25:46.480
Hengtang is still the same.

25:47.160 --> 25:48.920
His Majesty surely didn't expect

25:48.920 --> 25:50.510
that Hu Xing and Xie Shu

25:50.590 --> 25:52.550
have been putting on an act all along.

25:52.550 --> 25:54.070
What are your plans next?

25:54.400 --> 25:56.350
If there's anything we can help you with,

25:56.350 --> 25:57.350
just ask.

25:59.110 --> 26:00.570
Thank you, Magistrate Ye.

26:01.830 --> 26:02.960
For all these years,

26:03.680 --> 26:05.540
if you hadn't helped me in secret,

26:06.510 --> 26:07.910
I wouldn't be here today.

26:10.640 --> 26:13.100
We were inspired
by your father's dying wish

26:13.270 --> 26:14.920
to enter officialdom.

26:15.270 --> 26:16.440
Back then, he was determined to implement

26:16.440 --> 26:17.560
the new equalization reforms,
replacing the head tax

26:17.560 --> 26:19.110
with a land tax based on landholdings

26:19.110 --> 26:20.910
to ease the people's tax burden,

26:21.440 --> 26:24.700
thereby breaking
the noble families' monopoly over land.

26:25.000 --> 26:27.460
Now the refugees
have gathered into a force.

26:27.920 --> 26:29.310
Hu Xing and Xie Shu

26:29.510 --> 26:31.240
have already mobilized their troops,

26:31.240 --> 26:33.040
planning to crush them by force.

26:33.240 --> 26:34.550
A war is about to erupt.

26:35.160 --> 26:37.240
All it needs is someone to light the fuse.

26:37.240 --> 26:38.310
Che and I

26:38.550 --> 26:40.010
will light the first fire.

26:40.510 --> 26:42.770
Once the fire spreads through Hengtang,

26:43.200 --> 26:44.470
you'll add fuel to it

26:45.270 --> 26:46.480
in the court

26:47.440 --> 26:49.970
and let it spread
throughout the government.

26:50.590 --> 26:52.480
The court was already shaken by the death

26:52.480 --> 26:53.940
of the Marquis of Danyang.

26:54.310 --> 26:55.920
His Majesty is still watching

26:55.920 --> 26:57.920
and has yet to make a final decision.

26:57.920 --> 26:58.640
Shen Run,

26:59.270 --> 27:00.790
you know how unpredictable

27:00.790 --> 27:02.000
the court can be.

27:02.790 --> 27:04.920
His Majesty may secretly support you,

27:04.960 --> 27:06.750
but in public, he'll side with

27:07.270 --> 27:09.200
whichever way the wind is blowing.

27:09.400 --> 27:10.510
If you act now

27:10.830 --> 27:12.640
without absolute certainty,

27:13.070 --> 27:15.640
and the uprising
is successfully suppressed,

27:15.640 --> 27:17.040
I'm afraid it will be hard

27:17.480 --> 27:19.480
to predict what His Majesty will do.

27:20.750 --> 27:21.480
I know.

27:23.720 --> 27:24.920
That's why this time,

27:26.400 --> 27:27.480
we can only

27:28.310 --> 27:29.270
succeed.

27:40.400 --> 27:42.400
This is already the last of the soup.

27:43.000 --> 27:43.720
Why don't we

27:44.960 --> 27:46.490
split some people up first?

27:47.200 --> 27:50.000
Otherwise, sooner or later,
there'll be trouble.

27:52.830 --> 27:53.510
No.

27:53.790 --> 27:54.880
They lost their fields

27:54.880 --> 27:55.920
and homes.

27:56.270 --> 27:57.510
This is their last hope

27:57.510 --> 27:58.690
of survival.

27:59.590 --> 28:00.480
There's

28:01.110 --> 28:02.970
no turning back for Hengtang now.

28:03.880 --> 28:04.920
The carts are here!

28:04.920 --> 28:06.320
The grain carts are here!

28:08.690 --> 28:10.290
The grain is here!

28:10.790 --> 28:12.170
The grain is here!

28:12.510 --> 28:14.000
The grain is here!

28:15.570 --> 28:16.650
We have grain now!

28:17.960 --> 28:19.960
How did the grain turn into weapons?

28:22.960 --> 28:24.220
How did it turn into weapons?

28:24.220 --> 28:25.480
Shouldn't it be grain?

28:27.000 --> 28:28.060
Where is the grain?

28:34.880 --> 28:36.410
Isn't this Commander Shen?

28:36.550 --> 28:37.160
He is not dead?

28:37.160 --> 28:38.000
It really is him!

28:38.000 --> 28:39.160
-Hurry.
-Let's go.

28:40.070 --> 28:41.240
Let's go have a look.

28:44.510 --> 28:45.720
You are not mistaken.

28:46.480 --> 28:47.550
I am Shen Run.

28:48.070 --> 28:49.930
I'm here today for only one thing—

28:50.240 --> 28:54.240
to clear out the deep-rooted ills
that have plagued Hengtang for years.

28:54.440 --> 28:56.040
I believe you know my father,

28:56.310 --> 28:57.400
Shen Zhibai.

28:57.940 --> 29:05.110
[Respectfully submitted
by Your Majesty's servant, Shen Zhibai]

28:58.270 --> 28:59.240
Nine years ago,

28:59.790 --> 29:02.480
my father drafted
this Ten Suggestions on Equalization.

29:02.480 --> 29:03.240
He called for

29:03.790 --> 29:05.160
land surveys and equal taxation,

29:05.160 --> 29:06.080
as well as a reform of corvée labor
and grain levies,

29:06.080 --> 29:07.790
to save the people from hardship.

29:07.790 --> 29:08.790
Sadly,

29:09.640 --> 29:12.600
[Respectfully submitted
by Your Majesty's servant, Shen Zhibai]

29:10.960 --> 29:12.960
before the new policies
could even be implemented,

29:12.960 --> 29:14.960
he was killed by corrupt officials,

29:15.590 --> 29:17.590
and our entire family was wiped out.

29:18.590 --> 29:20.000
Only Shen Che and I

29:20.510 --> 29:21.400
survived.

29:24.350 --> 29:25.680
And what is Hengtang

29:26.110 --> 29:27.350
like now?

29:27.790 --> 29:28.790
Outside the city,

29:29.160 --> 29:31.240
people are starving to death faster
than their bodies can be buried.

29:31.240 --> 29:32.000
Inside,

29:32.400 --> 29:34.160
Zuixian Tavern is filled with music
and laughter every night,

29:34.160 --> 29:36.590
while the rich and powerful
drink and feast.

29:36.590 --> 29:37.720
To them,

29:39.030 --> 29:41.270
you're nothing
but a bunch of troublemakers.

29:41.270 --> 29:42.160
Your lives

29:42.590 --> 29:43.720
mean less to them

29:44.400 --> 29:46.400
than the leftovers on their tables.

29:49.400 --> 29:50.550
But I don't see you

29:50.830 --> 29:52.000
as troublemakers.

29:52.550 --> 29:54.510
You're ordinary people
who had your land seized

29:54.510 --> 29:55.710
and your homes taken,

29:55.750 --> 29:58.010
and were driven into becoming refugees.

29:58.720 --> 30:00.550
You're the people
who've suffered the most,

30:00.550 --> 30:01.750
borne the heaviest burden

30:01.750 --> 30:02.960
in this world.

30:03.680 --> 30:04.940
If we don't fight back,

30:05.720 --> 30:07.650
this suffering will be passed down

30:07.920 --> 30:09.680
from generation to generation.

30:09.680 --> 30:10.750
Now the new Emperor

30:11.030 --> 30:12.550
is determined to set things right,

30:12.550 --> 30:14.070
abolish the old ways, establish new ones,

30:14.070 --> 30:16.440
and vigorously implement
the equalization reforms.

30:16.440 --> 30:17.240
Hu Xing

30:17.750 --> 30:19.550
and the Xia's faction behind him

30:19.830 --> 30:22.160
are the last remnants standing in the way.

30:22.480 --> 30:23.240
I can't promise

30:23.240 --> 30:25.640
that every one of you
will return unharmed.

30:25.640 --> 30:26.770
But I can promise you

30:27.790 --> 30:29.650
that Hengtang will see a new dawn.

30:30.110 --> 30:31.710
Your children will no longer

30:32.510 --> 30:34.550
have to suffer from hunger and cold.

30:37.000 --> 30:38.030
I can promise

30:38.790 --> 30:40.320
that as long as we're alive,

30:40.590 --> 30:42.990
as long as my brothers and I
can still stand,

30:44.110 --> 30:46.000
we'll always stand before you.

30:48.310 --> 30:49.270
Those officials

30:49.440 --> 30:50.440
have soldiers and food.

30:50.440 --> 30:51.170
How can we...

30:51.200 --> 30:52.640
How can we possibly fight them?

30:52.640 --> 30:53.270
Yeah.

30:54.070 --> 30:54.830
How?

30:54.830 --> 30:56.070
They have soldiers and food.

30:56.070 --> 30:57.680
Can we defeat them?

30:57.680 --> 30:58.030
Yeah.

30:58.030 --> 30:59.030
How can we fight?

31:01.510 --> 31:02.160
We can!

31:15.480 --> 31:17.160
A true man is born to stand tall.

31:17.160 --> 31:18.960
Why not make your name live on forever?

31:18.960 --> 31:21.240
Even though I am but a weak scholar,

31:21.880 --> 31:23.410
I am willing to risk my life,

31:24.310 --> 31:25.070
fighting the rebels

31:25.070 --> 31:26.160
with all of you

31:26.830 --> 31:27.750
and standing with you through it all!

31:27.750 --> 31:28.350
And us!

31:28.830 --> 31:29.830
There's no coward

31:29.830 --> 31:31.310
in the Palace Guard Division!

31:31.310 --> 31:32.970
We'll follow you to the death.

31:33.030 --> 31:34.440
We are not afraid of Hu Xing.

31:34.440 --> 31:35.070
That's right!

31:35.070 --> 31:36.000
We'll follow the Commander!

31:36.000 --> 31:37.460
We'll fight that bastard!

31:37.590 --> 31:38.720
We'll do whatever the Commander

31:38.720 --> 31:39.820
orders us to do!

31:40.240 --> 31:40.960
Let's fight!

31:40.960 --> 31:41.830
Together, we fight the rebels

31:41.830 --> 31:42.760
and stand as one!

31:42.920 --> 31:44.820
Together, we fight the rebels
and stand as one!

31:44.820 --> 31:46.650
Together, we fight the rebels
and stand as one!

31:46.650 --> 31:49.250
Together, we fight the rebels
and stand as one!

32:01.240 --> 32:03.100
This is the second jar of aged wine

32:03.590 --> 32:06.050
I set aside back
in the late Emperor's reign.

32:06.350 --> 32:07.200
I said

32:11.960 --> 32:13.030
I'd open it

32:14.000 --> 32:15.590
at the most important

32:15.830 --> 32:16.400
moment.

32:18.070 --> 32:20.000
This jar is for you two generals.

32:25.880 --> 32:27.810
It's wine to send you off to battle.

32:31.110 --> 32:31.720
Today,

32:33.310 --> 32:35.040
we'll celebrate ahead of time!

32:36.720 --> 32:38.680
We'll march out to quell the rebellion!

32:38.680 --> 32:40.740
We swear to defend Hengtang's peace!

32:41.070 --> 32:41.790
Good!

32:42.400 --> 32:44.480
On behalf of the people of Hengtang,

32:44.830 --> 32:46.350
I thank you two generals first!

32:46.350 --> 32:46.810
Come on!

32:47.550 --> 32:48.210
Bottoms up!

33:01.910 --> 33:05.190
[Zhongwu Hall]

33:15.510 --> 33:16.840
What are you doing here?

33:18.000 --> 33:19.030
I'm here to see

33:21.160 --> 33:23.270
just how remarkable the heir

33:24.000 --> 33:25.640
to the Marquis of Li,

33:26.000 --> 33:27.830
a hero all his life, truly is.

33:30.790 --> 33:31.640
Turns out,

33:34.110 --> 33:35.370
he's just a pile of mud.

33:39.920 --> 33:41.640
The traitors from the Danyang Army

33:41.640 --> 33:44.160
are slaughtering civilians
outside the city,

33:44.160 --> 33:46.090
under the banner of your Li family.

33:46.830 --> 33:47.890
Speaking of which,

33:48.000 --> 33:49.070
it's truly ironic.

33:50.440 --> 33:51.700
This was supposed to be

33:52.200 --> 33:55.480
the last righteous army
your father left behind for Hengtang.

33:55.480 --> 33:57.880
And now it's become a weapon
for slaughter.

34:04.880 --> 34:07.080
I think your father must have been blind

34:08.280 --> 34:09.920
to place the entire hope

34:10.920 --> 34:11.880
of the Marquis of Danyang household

34:11.880 --> 34:13.840
in a useless son like you.

34:26.630 --> 34:28.790
Say one more word about my father

34:29.440 --> 34:30.639
and see what happens.

34:32.920 --> 34:34.110
Quite a temper.

34:35.880 --> 34:38.010
So you do remember who your father was.

34:39.920 --> 34:43.250
Then do you remember the responsibility
on your shoulders?

34:44.580 --> 34:48.310
[Zhongwu Hall]

34:46.190 --> 34:47.440
So what if I remember?

34:50.400 --> 34:51.400
The world

34:52.150 --> 34:54.480
has already rotted to its core, hasn't it?

35:03.030 --> 35:05.360
Wasn't your father's death proof enough?

35:07.480 --> 35:08.550
Then what about my father's death?

35:08.550 --> 35:09.810
Was that proof enough?

35:10.710 --> 35:12.150
If your father

35:12.510 --> 35:13.710
had turned a blind eye

35:14.030 --> 35:15.000
back then,

35:15.510 --> 35:18.040
perhaps your Shen family
would still be here,

35:18.070 --> 35:19.930
and you'd still have your father.

35:21.840 --> 35:22.970
But what about mine?

35:24.190 --> 35:26.450
If he hadn't gotten involved in all this,

35:27.510 --> 35:30.230
he could've stayed a Marquis peacefully!

35:31.190 --> 35:32.650
And he wouldn't have died.

35:39.550 --> 35:41.800
What happened to good men

35:42.800 --> 35:43.400
like them?

35:48.320 --> 35:50.320
They were either wrongfully killed

35:52.590 --> 35:54.400
or forced to their deaths.

35:59.550 --> 36:01.150
And who's left alive?

36:05.320 --> 36:07.110
People like Xie Shu

36:07.880 --> 36:09.110
and Hu Xing!

36:11.630 --> 36:14.110
And this rotten world!

36:16.480 --> 36:18.510
Isn't all of this proof enough?

36:18.840 --> 36:20.000
Isn't it enough to prove

36:20.000 --> 36:22.360
that this world is beyond saving?

36:33.190 --> 36:33.920
Congxin,

36:35.400 --> 36:36.200
you're wrong.

36:39.840 --> 36:41.670
They didn't sacrifice themselves

36:41.670 --> 36:44.330
because they believed Hengtang
could be saved.

36:44.590 --> 36:45.720
Quite the opposite.

36:47.400 --> 36:48.550
They knew that

36:48.550 --> 36:50.550
greed and evil in this world

36:51.110 --> 36:52.640
could never be eradicated,

36:56.320 --> 37:00.180
and that's precisely why they were willing
to sacrifice their lives.

37:01.190 --> 37:02.920
It's precisely because people

37:04.960 --> 37:07.000
like our fathers exist in this world

37:08.960 --> 37:10.670
that the nights of Hengtang

37:11.550 --> 37:13.000
won't lose all their light.

37:13.000 --> 37:15.260
Who cares about this little bit of light?

37:16.920 --> 37:17.510
It can't

37:17.510 --> 37:18.800
even light my way,

37:19.230 --> 37:21.160
yet it requires lives to ignite it!

37:23.070 --> 37:23.880
Is it worth it?

37:26.030 --> 37:26.760
No, it isn't.

37:47.000 --> 37:47.930
What did you say?

37:55.880 --> 37:57.210
I said it isn't worth it.

37:59.320 --> 38:01.050
I'm saying your father's death

38:01.760 --> 38:03.320
meant nothing.

38:03.550 --> 38:04.550
Are you satisfied

38:04.800 --> 38:05.800
with this answer?

38:19.000 --> 38:20.000
It's not worth it!

38:38.500 --> 38:47.400
[Zhongwu Hall]

38:49.190 --> 38:50.880
Ten years ago, the Marquis

38:52.840 --> 38:54.400
was the only one who stood up

38:54.400 --> 38:55.710
for my father.

38:59.630 --> 39:01.760
Back then, every official in Hengtang

39:03.320 --> 39:04.760
sang the same tune

39:05.190 --> 39:07.440
and pinned the blame on my father.

39:08.480 --> 39:09.630
Only your father

39:11.030 --> 39:11.960
stood up.

39:14.480 --> 39:15.840
In this world,

39:18.760 --> 39:19.890
you can seek wealth,

39:20.920 --> 39:22.000
fame,

39:23.510 --> 39:25.400
even a little justice.

39:26.880 --> 39:28.630
But innocence

39:29.960 --> 39:31.400
is something

39:33.960 --> 39:35.620
so many people can never have.

39:38.360 --> 39:39.550
Yet the Marquis,

39:40.880 --> 39:41.880
your father,

39:44.550 --> 39:45.810
gave us our innocence.

39:49.320 --> 39:50.510
He lit a light,

39:53.150 --> 39:54.610
and that light shone on me.

39:54.950 --> 39:58.980
[Zhongwu Hall]

40:00.190 --> 40:01.760
I cherish that light.

40:04.110 --> 40:05.310
I'm not afraid to die.

40:08.000 --> 40:09.150
Maybe our deaths

40:09.510 --> 40:10.910
won't be worth it either.

40:12.800 --> 40:13.730
But I believe...

40:16.150 --> 40:17.550
I believe that one day,

40:19.920 --> 40:20.710
Hengtang

40:22.670 --> 40:24.800
will be worthy of the word "innocent."

40:29.230 --> 40:29.800
Yes.

40:32.030 --> 40:34.190
Maybe we won't live to see that day.

40:36.800 --> 40:37.860
It doesn't matter.

40:39.710 --> 40:42.110
As long as
someone keeps walking this path,

40:44.280 --> 40:45.630
hope won't die,

40:47.840 --> 40:48.570
and the light

40:50.670 --> 40:51.840
will not dim.

41:04.070 --> 41:04.590
So what?

41:09.030 --> 41:10.920
So you came here

41:13.400 --> 41:15.400
just to tell me about

41:16.230 --> 41:17.290
these old stories?

41:24.760 --> 41:26.030
I'm here to invite you

41:28.440 --> 41:29.360
to join me.

41:40.800 --> 41:42.530
Many people are waiting for us.

41:46.110 --> 41:47.320
Every commoner

41:48.590 --> 41:49.550
is waiting.

41:52.400 --> 41:54.110
They are waiting for a chance,

41:57.760 --> 41:59.440
a chance to survive.

42:00.230 --> 42:01.320
This chance

42:05.030 --> 42:06.630
is in our hands.
